Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.56,0:00:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 你俩都死多少次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, how many times did you two die anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.35,0:00:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个人的力量远强于米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is someone besides Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.98,0:00:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能够对付路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}strong enough to take on Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.87,0:00:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.74,0:00:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找到上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna find god.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.42,0:00:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.39,0:00:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个护身符\N{\fnArial\fs30}An amulet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.29,0:00:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在上帝附近会有剧烈反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}It burns hot in god's presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.23,0:00:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够帮助我找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll help me find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我可没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.36,0:00:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.30,0:00:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比叔叔给我的 说是这东西很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Bobby gave it to me. Said it was real special.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.51,0:00:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 萨姆 我很喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Sam. I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.92,0:00:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能借我吗 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- May I borrow it? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.70,0:00:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.60,0:00:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,可别弄丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.55,0:00:50.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.75,0:01:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在找这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.06,0:01:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,早啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mornin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.71,0:01:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 举起手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up. Hands where I can see 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.16,0:01:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.83,0:01:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that you, Roy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.29,0:01:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.22,0:01:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就是沃尔特了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which makes you Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.77,0:01:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 沃尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya, Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.06,0:01:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,面罩没用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.83,0:01:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我多心了吗 你俩好像有点不高兴啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, is it just me, or do you two seem a tad upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.98,0:01:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你造成了天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can flip the switch on the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.69,0:01:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为自己能一走了之吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and just walk away, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.26,0:01:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听谁说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who told you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.19,0:01:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不止是我们在追捕你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't the only hunters after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.29,0:01:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,下辈子见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you in the next life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.61,0:01:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 让我解释一下好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear me out. I can explain, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.09,0:01:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.65,0:02:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay the hell down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.22,0:02:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.73,0:02:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死萨姆是没错 但是迪恩的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing Sam was right, but Dean …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.63,0:02:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们别无选择 我们杀了他弟弟 你个白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made us, and we just snuffed his brother, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.79,0:02:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你想下半辈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to spend the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.17,0:02:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,都笼罩在被迪恩·温彻斯特追杀的阴影下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}knowing Dean Winchester's on your ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.73,0:02:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.59,0:02:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 罗伊 动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, Roy. Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.94,0:02:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我可警告你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm gonna warn you …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.34,0:02:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,老子一旦回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I come back…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.87,0:02:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可就死惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.12,0:02:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.68,0:02:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,要杀就杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get this show on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.04,0:02:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不来我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.12,0:03:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第5季第16集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.99,0:03:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.95,0:03:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.23,0:03:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这什么怪梦啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.99,0:03:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有火吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got your lighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.39,0:03:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦 我已经好多年没见过这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. I haven't seen this in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.19,0:03:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,点火吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire 'em up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.04,0:04:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.57,0:04:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是1996年的国庆日\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's 4th of July, 1996.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.52,0:04:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸从不允许我们这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad would never let us do anything like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.03,0:04:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 迪恩 这太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Dean. This is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.34,0:04:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,要爆炸啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire in the hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.44,0:05:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.97,0:05:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.32,0:05:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.03,0:05:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.97,0:05:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能别偷窥我的清梦了好不\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to stop poking around in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.88,0:05:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有隐私啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need some "Me" Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.93,0:05:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好听清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me very closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.67,0:05:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.47,0:05:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这是啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.54,0:05:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实你心里早就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep down, you already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.75,0:06:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.05,0:06:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,节哀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Condolences.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.50,0:06:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.59,0:06:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.99,0:06:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.50,0:06:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会到天堂来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did I get to heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.59,0:06:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.70,0:06:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个能让我你谈话的咒语很难维持\N{\fnArial\fs30}This spell, this connection … it's difficult to maintain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.95,0:06:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我在天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait … I-if I'm in heaven…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.76,0:06:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆哪儿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then where's Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.22,0:06:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.47,0:06:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你啥意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, what do I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.51,0:06:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人看到的是隧道或者一条河\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people see a tunnel or a river.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.60,0:06:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.94,0:06:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到仪表板 我在车里 在一条路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. M-my dash. I'm in my car. I'm on a road.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.46,0:06:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 一条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right … a road.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.41,0:06:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的话看到的是一条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you, it's a road.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.68,0:06:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,沿着路往前走 迪恩 你就会找到萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow it, Dean. You'll find Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.07,0:06:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,沿着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.85,0:06:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}…road.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.03,0:07:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.83,0:07:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.76,0:07:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你刚到麦金利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you're new to McKinley.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.29,0:07:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 先生 才到两周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, yes, sir … two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,史黛芬妮一直说起你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stephanie over here just can't seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.94,0:07:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直是说个没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}to stop talking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.44,0:07:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.24,0:07:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个…啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just…wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.47,0:07:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.83,0:07:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会在我梦里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing in my dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.48,0:07:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸是干什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what does your father do for a living?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.18,0:07:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.98,0:07:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.07,0:07:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.07,0:07:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们怎么会到天堂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, how are we in heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.85,0:07:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直在降妖除魔嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that clean living, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Um…Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.08,0:08:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的话我能明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, I get. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.99,0:08:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但为什么我也在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.20,0:08:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能没意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you haven't noticed, but, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.04,0:08:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我做过的那些事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've…done a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时以为做的是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought you were doing the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.03,0:08:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知 该不该上天堂的标准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last I checked, it wasn't the road to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.79,0:08:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是初衷 而是后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was paved with good intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.33,0:08:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里要是天国 天国可真逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, if this is the skymall, it sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.64,0:08:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,3P和塑胶娃娃在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, where's the triplets and the latex, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.79,0:08:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,人可是有需求的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. A guy has needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.56,0:08:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 据说人挂了之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, when you bite dust,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.83,0:08:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多过往的记忆会在眼前闪过\N{\fnArial\fs30}they say your life flashes before your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.96,0:08:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.58,0:08:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这幢房子 是我的回忆之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}This house … it's one of my memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.92,0:08:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我醒过来的时候 也是在自己的记忆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I woke up, I woke up in one of my memories…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.35,0:08:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,国庆日那天我们放烟花把一片草地给烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the 4th of July that we burned down that field.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.78,0:08:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许天堂就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe that's what heaven is…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.91,0:08:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你再一次经历你最光荣的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}A place where you relive your greatest hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.45,0:08:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 这么说 在里面跟牙套女调情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait… so, playing footsie with brace-face in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.76,0:08:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的得意时刻咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}t-that… that's a trophy moment for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.49,0:08:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我那时候才11岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I was 11 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.54,0:08:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我第一个像样的感恩节\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was my first real Thanksgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.50,0:08:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么呢 我们每年都过感恩节\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? We had Thanksgiving every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.67,0:08:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,无非是一桶鸡块\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a bucket of extra-crispy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.66,0:08:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有老爸坐在沙发上睡死过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and dad passed out on the couch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.20,0:09:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得有这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.80,0:09:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们应该… - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We should, uh… - Yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.71,0:09:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才那是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.40,0:09:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不清楚 不过待会儿下楼要坐扶梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, but we are taking the escalator back downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.19,0:09:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.68,0:09:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.82,0:09:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看像做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.38,0:09:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是你疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you've lost your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.97,0:09:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西之前就用收音机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass talked to me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.71,0:09:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我「长途」通话的 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Using this… this "Phone home" radio thing, so I…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.53,0:09:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.51,0:09:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.85,0:09:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass? Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.60,0:09:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到萨姆了 但刚才发生一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, so, I found Sam, b-but something just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.02,0:09:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一束奇怪的光柱\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was this weird beam of light…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.86,0:09:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让光照到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go into the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.46,0:10:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 多谢 卡洛琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Thanks… Caroline.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.24,0:10:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.05,0:10:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是什么 是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not what… who.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.17,0:10:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是撒迦利亚 他在找你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zachariah. He's searching for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.45,0:10:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如过被他找到会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-and if he finds us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.59,0:10:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们死了是没法让米迦勒和路西法附身的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't say "Yes" To Michael and Lucifer if you're dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.02,0:10:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以撒迦利亚必须让你们复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Zachariah needs to return you to your bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.13,0:10:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 这不完事儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Problem solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.31,0:10:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不懂 你们已经到了天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't understand. Y-you're behind the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.58,0:10:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个绝佳的机遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a rare opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.47,0:10:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么机遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.32,0:10:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去找一个天使 他叫约书亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to find an angel. His name is Joshua.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.38,0:10:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, no offense,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.60,0:10:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们这儿天使多得要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we are kind of ass-full of angels, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.33,0:10:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去找吧 - 我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You find him. - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.86,0:10:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回不去天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't return to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.94,0:10:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,约书亚怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's so important about Joshua?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.01,0:10:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有传言说 他能跟上帝交谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rumor is, he talks to God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.57,0:10:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And? So?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.17,0:10:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道不觉得 我们至少 至少应当知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think maybe, just maybe, we should find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.34,0:10:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝到底怎么想的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}what the hell God has been saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.14,0:10:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他火了哎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geez. Touchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.38,0:10:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你们 沿着主轴走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. I just need you to follow the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.49,0:10:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么主轴\N{\fnArial\fs30}What road?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.39,0:10:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,它被称作世界的轴心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called the axis mundi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.36,0:10:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是纵贯天堂的一条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a path that runs through heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.94,0:10:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在不同的人眼中 它有不同的形态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Different people see it as different things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.23,0:10:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看到的是双车道公路\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you, it's two-lane asphalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.17,0:10:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,主轴会引领你们到达花园\N{\fnArial\fs30}The road will lead you to the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.16,0:10:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里 你们会找到约书亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll find Joshua there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.80,0:10:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,约书亚 他能带我们去找上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Joshua… He can take us to God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.53,0:10:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,花园\N{\fnArial\fs30}The garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.41,0:11:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.22,0:11:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, w-what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.77,0:11:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看我们就把墙砸碎 把约书亚猫捉出来咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we hit the yellow bricks, find this Joshua cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.95,0:11:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.39,0:11:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.18,0:11:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自然是 只是惊讶你也愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I, uh, I'm just surprised you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.61,0:11:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你之前一直想揍上帝一顿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, last I checked, you wanted to break God's nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.32,0:11:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你认为他能帮我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you think he can help?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.63,0:11:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有他能帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the only one who can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.60,0:11:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 萨姆 我们都光荣牺牲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, come on, Sam. We are royally boned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.11,0:11:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, prayer…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.00,0:11:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是绝望者最后的希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A last hope of a desperate man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.79,0:11:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面不是路来着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't there a street out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.07,0:11:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,原本是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.24,0:11:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.63,0:11:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.01,0:11:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,找主轴啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for a road.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.25,0:11:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,主轴会在衣柜里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… you think the road is in a closet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.97,0:11:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 这里可是天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in heaven, Sam, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.59,0:11:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,记忆成了现实 卡西上了电视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our memories are coming true, Cass is on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.82,0:12:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,衣柜里找条主轴出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finding a road in a closet would be pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.36,0:12:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可要算今天最正常的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most normal thing to happen to us today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.19,0:12:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.77,0:12:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to have one of these…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.22,0:12:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个一模一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.88,0:12:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是主轴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.24,0:12:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,够梦幻的哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty trippy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.57,0:12:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,更梦幻的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}More trippy…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.41,0:12:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,很显然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…Apparently…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.83,0:12:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你「要抱抱」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You "Wuv hugz."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.40,0:12:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.01,0:12:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 我知道我们在哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. I know where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.91,0:12:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.84,0:12:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.37,0:13:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 饿不饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dean, you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.00,0:13:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,面包皮要切掉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want the crusts cut off?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.44,0:13:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,要 我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I… I'd love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.67,0:13:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.51,0:13:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来这不是你的记忆 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it's not your memory, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.29,0:13:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.74,0:13:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}we should…go …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.63,0:13:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续寻找主轴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep looking for the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.86,0:13:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 再等我一下行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Just … just give me a minute, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.97,0:13:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 萨姆 拜托了 再等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean - Sam, please. One minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.17,0:13:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.18,0:13:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.31,0:14:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再谈论这件事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not having this conversation again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.22,0:14:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么需要考虑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to think about what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.70,0:14:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,家里有两个孩子在等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have two boys at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.90,0:14:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸妈大吵一架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom and dad were fighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.09,0:14:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后爸爸就搬出去住了几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then he moved out for a couple days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.83,0:14:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸老说他的婚姻很完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad always said they had the perfect marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.32,0:14:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是在妈妈去世之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't perfect until after she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.94,0:14:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那就不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Then don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.23,0:14:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没什么好谈的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing more to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.19,0:14:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens next?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.38,0:14:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸还是爱你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad still loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.41,0:14:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.06,0:14:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远都不会离开你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.04,0:14:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 真是我的小天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…are my little angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.38,0:14:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,想吃点派吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout some pie?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.94,0:14:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.66,0:15:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,咋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.70,0:15:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚才发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just never realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.53,0:15:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么久都是你在帮爸爸善后\N{\fnArial\fs30}how long you've been cleaning up dad's messes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.55,0:15:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓了 咱们上路吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever. Let's keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.69,0:15:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前在哪见过这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen this somewhere before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.64,0:15:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.39,0:15:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.08,0:15:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.58,0:15:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,骨头 嘿 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bones! Hey, come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.05,0:15:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.43,0:15:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.11,0:15:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bones?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.03,0:16:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 骨头是我的狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Bones was my dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.11,0:16:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的 你的狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your … your dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.27,0:16:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.42,0:16:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里难道是弗拉格斯塔夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this Flagstaff?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.87,0:16:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.38,0:16:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好呀伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.27,0:16:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对你这算是一段美好的回忆啊 - 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is a good memory for you? - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.30,0:16:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于自己住了两周\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I was on my own for two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.66,0:16:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,天天靠零食和饮料过活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lived off of Funyuns and Mr. Pibb.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.84,0:16:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.48,0:16:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经不记得了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't remember, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.87,0:16:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我负责照看你的时候离家出走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ran away on my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.92,0:16:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我四处找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I looked everywhere for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.26,0:16:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.76,0:16:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到爸爸回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when dad came home…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.23,0:16:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我十分抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, look … I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.34,0:16:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没站在你的角度想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I never thought about it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.46,0:16:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧 咱们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it. Let's roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.16,0:17:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.97,0:17:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,小骨 别跟来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bonesy, stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.98,0:17:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这又是哪段记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What memory is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.77,0:17:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.50,0:17:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 咱们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.26,0:17:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.61,0:17:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,主轴 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Road, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.35,0:17:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.66,0:17:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 别急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.98,0:17:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.63,0:17:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你甩开我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the night you ditched us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.69,0:17:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,去斯坦福的那晚 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}for Stanford, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.11,0:17:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你梦想的天堂就是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your idea of heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.77,0:17:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那晚可算是我人生中最糟糕的一晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was, like, one of the worst nights of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.98,0:17:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没法控制这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't control this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.77,0:17:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.75,0:17:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对你来说是幸福的回忆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a happy memory for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.27,0:17:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 当时就我一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I mean, I was on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.07,0:17:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于离开了爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I finally got away from dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.36,0:18:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀 你离开的可不光是他一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he wasn't the only one you got away from.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.14,0:18:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 真的很抱歉 我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I'm sorry. I-I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.99,0:18:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是是 我知道 你没站在我的角度想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know … y-you didn't think of it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.42,0:18:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 行了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.57,0:18:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的天堂是和别人一起过感恩节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your heaven is somebody else's thanksgiving, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.55,0:18:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是扔下你自己的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bailing on your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.34,0:18:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还想让我说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.43,0:18:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.63,0:18:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来都没人帮我切过面包的边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never got the crusts cut off my PB&J.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.98,0:18:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.51,0:18:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是我看待家庭的角度和你不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I just don't look at family the way you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.84,0:18:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 可我是你的家人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I'm your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.23,0:18:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 我们应当是一个整体\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know - We're supposed to be a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.94,0:18:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算全世界与我为敌 你也应该站我这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's supposed to be you and me against the world, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.69,0:18:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 是这样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.53,0:18:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.41,0:18:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快走 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.45,0:19:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲避天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Running from angels…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.68,0:19:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,用跑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}on foot…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.63,0:19:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是在天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.14,0:19:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么有创意\N{\fnArial\fs30}With out-of-the-box thinking like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.78,0:19:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没能阻止天启真是让我惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm surprised you boys haven't stopped the Apocalypse already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.16,0:19:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 有什么问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, what's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.11,0:19:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想把你们送回人间 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to send you back to earth. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.50,0:19:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that is,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.88,0:19:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然要等我重新建立一个世界之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}after I tear you a cosmos of new ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.53,0:19:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们现在在我地盘上了 小子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on my turf now, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.53,0:19:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到我玩够你们的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}and by the time I'm through with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.02,0:19:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会求着说「同意」的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna be begging to say "Yes."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.49,0:19:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子们 别傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.63,0:19:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲得了初一躲不了十五\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can run, but you can't run.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.73,0:19:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.70,0:20:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait … Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.35,0:20:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好啊 小贱人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buenos dias, bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.00,0:20:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ash?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.66,0:20:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到我的蓝色天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to my blue heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.28,0:20:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 那家酒馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, the road house.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.44,0:20:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至连味道都没变\N{\fnArial\fs30}It even smells the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.05,0:20:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,啤酒 血液 还有下酒菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bud, blood, and beer nuts …
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.56,0:20:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上最好闻的味道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the best smell in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.63,0:20:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,来杯冰的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout a cold one?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.36,0:20:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿 喝不醉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up here, no hangover.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.94,0:20:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.29,0:20:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, no offense …
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.20,0:20:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我这种邋遢鬼死后怎么还能上天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's a dirtbag like me end up in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.44,0:20:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,吾乃得救赎者 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I been saved, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.58,0:20:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是首席训蛇人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was my congregation's number-one snake handler.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.15,0:20:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你所谓的天堂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-and you said this was your heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.24,0:21:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我私人 专属的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. My own…Personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.43,0:21:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以天使们紧咬着我们不放时 我们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when the angels jumped us, we were…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.91,0:21:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在你们的天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.60,0:21:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就说有两个天堂咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there are two heavens?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.74,0:21:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 有超多个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, more like 100 billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.25,0:21:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, no worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.00,0:21:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,要追到你们可得费点儿神\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll take them angel boys a minute to catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.62,0:21:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wha…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.71,0:21:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们别以为天堂是一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, you got to stop thinking of heaven as one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.13,0:21:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,更像是好多地方挤在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more like a buttload of places all crammed together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.08,0:21:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像迪斯尼乐园那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Disneyland,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.58,0:21:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了没那些反犹太教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except without all the anti-semitism.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.59,0:21:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪斯尼乐园吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disneyland?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.12,0:21:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你们有温切斯特乐园\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, see, you got winchesterland…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.28,0:21:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这是阿瑟乐园\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashland…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.52,0:21:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这些每一个独立乐园\N{\fnArial\fs30}A whole mess of everybody-else-lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.89,0:21:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,拼凑在一起 就成了天堂 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put 'em all together … heaven, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.40,0:21:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,而在各色乐园的中心都有一个梦幻国度\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the center of it all is the magic kingdom …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.73,0:21:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,花园\N{\fnArial\fs30}The garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.07,0:21:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就说每个人都在天堂中有一席位\N{\fnArial\fs30}So everybody gets a little slice of paradise?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.93,0:21:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.61,0:22:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,少数的会共享 那是特殊情况 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Few people share … special cases, what not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.81,0:22:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,特殊情况 是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "Special"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.02,0:22:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白 像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you know, like…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.25,0:22:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵魂伴侣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soul mates.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.05,0:22:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,总的来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyways…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.25,0:22:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分人没法离开他们那块地儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most people can't leave their own private idahos.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.01,0:22:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不是那部分人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you ain't most people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.85,0:22:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他们可没我这能耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. They ain't got my skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.41,0:22:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 我已经转了个遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I have been all over …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.08,0:22:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到过约翰尼·卡什 巨人安德雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny Cash… Andre the giant…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.90,0:22:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有爱因斯坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Einstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.17,0:22:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 那家伙能调出白俄鸡尾酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, that man can mix a white Russian.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.60,0:22:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天 我碰到麦尔纳格·瓦茨亚亚那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, the other day, I found mallanaga vatsyayana's.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.45,0:22:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.06,0:22:37.33,Title,0,0,0,0,,《性爱圣经》的作者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrote "The kama sutra."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.06,0:22:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人的天堂 销魂软骨啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That boy's heaven … oh, sweaty, confusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.54,0:22:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话竟出自曾睡在台球桌上的家伙之口\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this from a guy who used to sleep on a pool table.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.39,0:22:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 如今我死了 又复活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, now that I'm dead, I'm livin', man …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.99,0:22:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且活得更加精彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}A whole lot more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.07,0:22:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么找到我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how'd you find us?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.25,0:22:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我组装了一台唯我仅有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rigged up my very own…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.25,0:22:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,神音波频侦查扫描仪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy rollin' police scanner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.53,0:23:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是天使的声音 在说以诺语\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's angels, blabbin' enochian, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.34,0:23:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都听得懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fluent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.27,0:23:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到你俩上来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard that you were up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.39,0:23:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然我不得不去找你们 又一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Course I had to come find you … again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.88,0:23:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,再一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.75,0:23:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这已经不是你们第一次上来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't the first time you been here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.47,0:23:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩是我见过死过最多回的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you boys die more than anyone I have ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.05,0:23:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.49,0:23:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 你们根本就不记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yeah. You don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.04,0:23:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 一定是天使们给你们洗脑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God! Angels … must have windexed your brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.07,0:23:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你找到其他人了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, I mean, have you found anybody else?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.58,0:23:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如埃伦和乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen and jo?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.99,0:23:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃论和乔都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen and jo are dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.25,0:23:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 已经有几个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah. Yeah, a few months now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.38,0:23:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.63,0:23:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们是在战斗中死的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, they went down fightin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.11,0:23:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 战斗到了最后一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah … to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.55,0:23:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 牺牲得相当值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a lot of good it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.27,0:23:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的亲人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about our folks?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.38,0:24:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在找约翰·温切斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been lookin' all over for John Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.06,0:24:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.98,0:24:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前为止 都一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far, nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.53,0:24:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.06,0:24:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 倒是有个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, hey, there is somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.08,0:24:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道她很想和你俩聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who I know for sure wants to jaw with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.98,0:24:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.13,0:24:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕梅拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pamela.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.34,0:24:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴能再见到你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to see you boys again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.72,0:24:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是靠这个来去自如的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is how you get around up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.37,0:24:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. More or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.69,0:24:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于能实际运用弦理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just awesome to finally have an application …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.67,0:24:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是超赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}A practical application for string theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.53,0:24:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.30,0:24:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.19,0:24:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一下你报复你让我被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's for getting me killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.58,0:24:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.27,0:24:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,打一下 还算轻的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's…Probably less than I deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.54,0:24:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能让你好受点儿的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it makes you feel any better,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.67,0:24:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿瑟也是被我们害死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we got Ash killed, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.99,0:24:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无所谓啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm cool with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.01,0:24:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's cool with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.46,0:24:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你呢 还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I mean… Are you good?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.92,0:24:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.35,0:25:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.33,0:25:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还记得死前的那一幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember my death scene …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.98,0:25:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,挨了一刀 口吐鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gutshot, coughing blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.87,0:25:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还对我说我能到更好的地方去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me I was going someplace better.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.65,0:25:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我瞎掰的 - 你说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was lying. - You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.73,0:25:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天堂 俨然世外桃园的无尽版\N{\fnArial\fs30}My heaven … it is one long show at the meadowlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.58,0:25:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是棒极了 你该来见识一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's amazing. You should see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.70,0:25:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.44,0:25:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不相信我说的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.74,0:25:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信 我相信 只不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I do. I-it's just, you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.59,0:25:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,无止尽的困在你那个天使掌控的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spending eternity trapped in your own little universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.18,0:25:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,小小的世界里 太寂寞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}while the angels run the show … that's lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.11,0:25:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 那根本就算不上天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, that's … that's not nirvana.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.97,0:25:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 更像是黑客帝国\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's…The matrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.43,0:25:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.32,0:25:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂至少比地狱好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attic's still better than the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.82,0:25:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是没错 但\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.05,0:25:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this place …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.56,0:25:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉虽然真实 但毕竟只是个复制品\N{\fnArial\fs30}It feels real, but it's memorex.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.76,0:25:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,最真实的世界是在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real is down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.32,0:25:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对的 很接近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, close enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.68,0:25:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 迪恩 我很快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Dean, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.59,0:25:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm at peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.95,0:26:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛 想让我也住进来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you trying to sell me a timeshare?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.45,0:26:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what's with the pitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.40,0:26:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.46,0:26:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,想利用你的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wants to take you out for a test drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.31,0:26:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帕梅拉 - 说说而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pamela - Just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.65,0:26:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你和他合作会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens if you play ball with him …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.58,0:26:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,最坏的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worst case?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.51,0:26:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of people die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.59,0:26:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他们会到这里来 这样不好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then they come here. That really so bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.49,0:26:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…Maybe…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.82,0:26:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用这么艰苦地战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to fight it so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.59,0:26:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我想说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I'm trying to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.17,0:26:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了去花园的捷径\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found a shortcut to the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.84,0:26:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.75,0:26:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有可以去梦幻国度的途径\N{\fnArial\fs30}All-access pass to the magic kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.57,0:26:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.25,0:26:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not good?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.09,0:26:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个撒迦利亚同学会监视\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Zach fella's gonna be watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.86,0:26:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,每条通向花园的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every road to the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.86,0:26:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}So watch your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.97,0:27:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.81,0:27:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如我所幻想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just how I imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.73,0:27:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.38,0:27:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是想打击你们 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mean to be a downer or anything, but, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.36,0:27:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定不久就会再见到你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure I'll see you again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.89,0:27:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就给我们留一盒冰啤酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, keep a sixer on ice for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.71,0:27:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.90,0:27:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.19,0:28:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we back home?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.50,0:28:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.60,0:28:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们接下来怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.80,0:28:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想还是继续找主轴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep looking for the road again, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.98,0:28:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 你怎么起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey? Why are you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.00,0:28:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm … I'm … I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.38,0:28:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 但你不是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you… But you're not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.66,0:28:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we don't have time …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.75,0:28:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做噩梦了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you have a nightmare?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.55,0:28:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.35,0:28:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.08,0:28:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我来告诉你我的噩梦怎么样 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how about I tell you my nightmare, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.77,0:28:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被烧死的那晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The night I burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.44,0:28:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,小萨姆 我们快离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.05,0:28:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you walk away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.65,0:28:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没有爱过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never loved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.07,0:28:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的负担\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were my burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.55,0:28:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你束缚了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was shackled to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.11,0:28:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我经历了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what it got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.13,0:29:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.38,0:29:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,最糟糕的是气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worst was the smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.38,0:29:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于痛楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pain, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.51,0:29:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮肤都烫到起泡了还能说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can you say about your skin bubbling off?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.65,0:29:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那个气味实在是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the smell was so…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.01,0:29:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一刹那\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, for a second,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.79,0:29:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为烤箱里面的炖肉烧焦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I left a pot roast burning in the oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.57,0:29:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 那是我的肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…It was my meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.87,0:29:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 我终于死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, finally, I was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.68,0:29:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸中的万幸就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one silver lining…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.85,0:30:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于离开你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that at least I was away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.68,0:30:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都离你而去 迪恩 你注意到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody leaves you, Dean. You noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.16,0:30:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.41,0:30:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.13,0:30:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.92,0:30:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有问过自己原因吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever ask yourself why?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.37,0:30:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许不是他们的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's not them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.54,0:30:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许 是你的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe…It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.83,0:30:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在放轻松点 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, now, kitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.71,0:30:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你干的好事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.38,0:30:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.72,0:30:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 你们真的认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, guys, did you really think.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.73,0:30:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以避开我偷偷溜到花园里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could just sneak past me into mission control?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.98,0:30:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.03,0:30:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我也会对你说同样的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'd say the same thing about you, sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.29,0:30:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但实际上我很喜欢你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have actually grown quite fond of your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.56,0:30:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者 至少是记忆中的她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, at least, the blessed memory of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.64,0:31:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们一定会共度很多美好时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're gonna be logging a lot of quality time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.98,0:31:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发觉她真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've discovered she's quite the…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.18,0:31:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,性感熟女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milf.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.35,0:31:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就自己得意吧 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can gloat all you want, you dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.72,0:31:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仍然是个秃子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still bald.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.64,0:31:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,在天堂 我有6个翅膀和4张脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}In heaven, I have six wings and four faces,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.22,0:31:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一个是狮子\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of which is a lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.16,0:31:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见这张脸是因为你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see this because you're…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.70,0:31:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,能力有限\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.47,0:31:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们讲点实质的 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's brass-tack this, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.37,0:31:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还想对我们性虐直到我们说同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you're gonna ball-gag us until we say "Yes"?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.17,0:31:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒听过这种调调\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Yeah, I've heard that tune.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.61,0:31:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想做的不止这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna do a lot more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.83,0:31:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都想好咋折腾你们了 扶他起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've cleared my schedule. Get him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.52,0:31:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.10,0:31:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经功成名就\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was on the fast track once.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.82,0:31:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都是每月最佳员工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Employee of the month every month … forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.67,0:31:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走过大厅时 我是众人的焦点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd walk these halls, and people would avert their eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.33,0:31:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受人尊敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had respect!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.10,0:32:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他们让我解决你们的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then they assigned me you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.89,0:32:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在看看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}now look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.71,0:32:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我竟然不能解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't close the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.98,0:32:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个穿着法兰绒的可怜虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}On a couple of pathetic, flannel-wearing maggots?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.95,0:32:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都嘲笑我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody's laughing at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.62,0:32:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're right to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.52,0:32:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 无论你们答应还是不答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…Say yes, don't say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.09,0:32:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是要折磨报复你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still gonna take it out of your asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.01,0:32:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是私人恩怨了 小伙们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's personal now, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.59,0:32:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将成为这个世界上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the last person in the history of creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.63,0:32:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们最可怕的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want as your enemy is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.70,0:32:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你们原因 路西法也许很强\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll tell you why … Lucifer may be strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.21,0:32:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.00,0:32:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,卑鄙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Petty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.07,0:32:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会成为你们的「守护」天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be the angel on your shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.01,0:32:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the rest of eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.14,0:32:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.88,0:32:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在办事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.19,0:32:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.61,0:32:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟他俩说几句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to speak to those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.16,0:32:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.86,0:32:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这不合时宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bad time, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.71,0:32:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但恐怕我得坚持这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm afraid I have to insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.80,0:33:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,还轮不到你来坚持什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't get to insist jack squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.03,0:33:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.30,0:33:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 老大要坚持\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the boss does.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.97,0:33:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他的旨意\N{\fnArial\fs30}His orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.84,0:33:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.31,0:33:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事可是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't lie about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.72,0:33:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大可以杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look… Fire me, if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.38,0:33:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他迟早会回家来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sooner or later, he's gonna come back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.91,0:33:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道盛怒之下他会如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know how he is with that whole "Wrath" thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.89,0:33:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是 天堂花园吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is…heaven's garden?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.86,0:33:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得还算不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice…ish. I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.07,0:34:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼之所见乃你们心中所想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see what you want to here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.48,0:34:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人看见神的王座之殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}For some it's god's throne room.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.64,0:34:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人看见伊甸园\N{\fnArial\fs30}For others it's eden.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.32,0:34:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩的话 我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.32,0:34:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是克里夫兰植物园\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the cleveland Botanical gardens.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.54,0:34:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩曾来此野游\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came here on a field trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.64,0:34:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是约书亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Joshua.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.71,0:34:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Joshua.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.10,0:34:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你与上帝交谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you talk to god?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.99,0:34:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常是他与我交谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly, he talks to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.15,0:34:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有话要对他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to speak to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.23,0:34:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,事态紧急\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.09,0:34:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在哪儿 - 地球上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is he? - On earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.55,0:34:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在干什么 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Doing what? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.36,0:34:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球上哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where on earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.90,0:34:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我们基本上不是面对面交谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Sorry. We don't exactly speak face-to-face.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.74,0:34:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我不太明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I…I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.87,0:34:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝不与任何人对话 那\N{\fnArial\fs30}God's not talking to nobody, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.30,0:34:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他为什么跟我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why is he talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.04,0:34:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时我觉得是因为我心存怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sometimes think it's because I can sympathize …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.17,0:34:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,能感同身受\N{\fnArial\fs30}gardener to gardener.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.20,0:34:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过我们之间的联系 我觉得他很孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}And between us, I think he is lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.18,0:35:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可真为他心碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}My heart's breaking for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.07,0:35:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能至少给我们传个话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you… at least get him a message for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.19,0:35:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实他给你们带话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, he has a message for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.24,0:35:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,「放弃吧」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Back off."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.16,0:35:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.13,0:35:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经知道了 所有你们要说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knews already. Everything you want to tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.08,0:35:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道天使们的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows what the angels are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.41,0:35:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道世界末日已经开启\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows that the apocalypse has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.76,0:35:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是不觉得这是他的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just doesn't think it's his problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.02,0:35:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他的问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not his problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.91,0:35:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝已经对你们施予救赎\N{\fnArial\fs30}God saved you already.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.61,0:35:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你们登上那飞机 救回了卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}He put you on that plane. He brought back castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.40,0:35:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他施恩让你们在天堂得救\N{\fnArial\fs30}He granted you salvation in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.69,0:35:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你们做出那一切后 他还是一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after everything you've done, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.30,0:35:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前这就已经与他无关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more than his intervened in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.23,0:35:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他职责已尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.82,0:35:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管有没有魔法护符\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magic amulet or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.48,0:35:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都找不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}you won't be able to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.18,0:35:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他能让事情结束 他能结束一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he can stop it. He could stop all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.94,0:35:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实 但他不会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose he could, but he won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.00,0:35:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.09,0:35:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当初为何会容忍恶魔存在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does he allow evil in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.29,0:35:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能动动愚蠢的脑子 想想这些问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could drive yourself nuts asking questions like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.76,0:36:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他就这么袖手旁观 隔岸观火吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he's just gonna sit back and watch the world burn?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.09,0:36:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这对你有多重要 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how important this was to you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.24,0:36:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.75,0:36:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.53,0:36:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,就又一个满嘴借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just another deadbeat dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.77,0:36:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不负责任的老头 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a bunch of excuses, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.74,0:36:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我习惯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm used to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.63,0:36:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会一样应付过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll muddle through.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.03,0:36:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你不知道 这次你是否能成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except you don't know if you can this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.97,0:36:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀不死路西法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't kill the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.78,0:36:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正失去信念\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're losing faith …
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.88,0:36:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去自我和兄弟 现在又变成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yourself, your brother, and now this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.30,0:36:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝是你最后的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}God was your last hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.58,0:36:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.83,0:36:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望事情不是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could tell you something different.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.48,0:36:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么知道你说的是真话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we know you're telling the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.40,0:36:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我会说谎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that I would lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.55,0:36:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.67,0:36:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可不是我们见过的第一个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not exactly the first angel we've met.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.99,0:36:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我站在你们那边 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm rooting for you boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.79,0:36:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我能帮助你们 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could do more to help you. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.08,0:36:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 我只整理树篱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… I just trim the hedges.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.21,0:36:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.09,0:37:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们再次回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go home again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.09,0:37:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕这次和上次不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid this time won't be like the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.95,0:37:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.41,0:37:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝希望你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}God wants you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.49,0:37:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,铭记一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.50,0:37:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.27,0:37:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样算「还好」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Define "All right."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.60,0:38:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.94,0:38:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能约书亚在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Joshua was lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.37,0:38:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这么认为 卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he was, cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.97,0:38:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.80,0:38:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.57,0:38:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾相信…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believed in…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.44,0:39:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再需要这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.27,0:39:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这毫无价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.04,0:39:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.14,0:39:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.90,0:39:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是能阻止这一切的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can still stop all this, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.67,0:39:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.84,0:39:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.57,0:39:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们会找到办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we'll find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.62,0:39:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.00,0:39:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find it.
